  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The skin of a myriad eyes clear bull’s body would hold not only water path dao marks but also light path dao marks, useful for refining investigative Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan has only part of the head skin, which is full of water path dao marks alone.",
